%% frame: Outbox event lifecycle (sys_outbox row)
stateDiagram-v2
    state "Pending" as P
    state "Published" as Pub
    state "Failed" as F
    P : due when nextAttemptAt is reached
    F : failedAt set, ERROR logged
    [*] --> P : «create» / insert
    P --> P : send failed [attempts + 1 < 10] / attempts + 1, retry after min(300, 2^attempts) s
    P --> Pub : send confirmed / publishedAt = now
    P --> F : send failed [attempts + 1 = 10] / failedAt = now
    F --> P : operator replay [cause fixed] / attempts = 0, failedAt = null
    Pub --> [*] : retention [published over 7 days ago] / delete
